Evo Verse (was Vendor) in the Misty format; feature report with charts; builder back button

- operators: Vendor platform renamed Evo Verse, tagline removed, its five
  features marked minimal (no chips, simulation hidden on the box tab,
  Document and Create Mystery Box buttons, Box Content and Odds, Analysis
  accordions after an open: maths, how the result was decided, was it fair,
  the logic). Misty page: chips removed.
